                                    </div>

                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>When should I move from 3PL to in-house?</h3>
                                        <p>Typically at ₹40-60 Cr ARR with predictable volume + specialty needs (kitting, personalization, cold chain). Below that, 3PL is more cost-effective.</p>
                                        <h3>Which 3PL is best in India?</h3>
                                        <p>Delhivery for scale, Shiprocket Fulfilment for SMB, Increff for premium D2C with detailed SLA needs. Test 2-3 before committing.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I offer free shipping?</h3>
                                        <p>Above your median AOV threshold, yes. Below, charge shipping — free shipping subsidy kills margin on low-AOV orders.</p>
                                        <h3>How do I handle India → UAE cross-border?</h3>
                                        <p>Delivered Duty Paid via Aramex / DHL. Configure duty + VAT calculation at checkout so customers see landed cost. Cross-border returns are expensive — factor into SKU selection.</p>
